	<Language_en_US>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG">
			<Text>Resourceful I (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG_HELP">
			<Text>This [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Legendary[ENDCOLOR] General is a savant at logistic. Able to manage rations efficiently, his troops are able to survive longer without resupplying.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG2">
			<Text>Resourceful II (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG2_HELP">
			<Text>This [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Legendary[ENDCOLOR] Experienced General has a strange ability of having plentiful supplies nearing the wilderness. Replaces [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Resourceful I[ENDCOLOR].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG3">
			<Text>Resourceful III (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_GG3_HELP">
			<Text>This [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Legendary[ENDCOLOR] Veteran General has an uncanny ability to make supplies appear out of nowhere. His troops are well-fed even with the break of supply lines. Replaces [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Resourceful II[ENDCOLOR].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT">
			<Text>Resourceful I</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT_HELP">
			<Text>Unit will heal every turn even if it performs an action. +10 additional HP regenerated in friendly territories. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Resourceful I[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT2">
			<Text>Resourceful II</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT2_HELP">
			<Text>Unit will heal every turn even if it performs an action. +10 additional HP regenerated in friendly and neutral territories. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Resourceful II[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT3">
			<Text>Resourceful III</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_SUFFICIENT3_HELP">
			<Text>Unit will heal every turn even if it performs an action. +10 additional HP regenerated in all territories. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Resourceful III[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
